OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785341919
OL,3,CTwo injured as man leads police on 45-
OL,4,Cminute car chase
OL,6,FGreater Manchester Police have
OL,7,Freleased footage of a high-speed
OL,8,Fpursuit through the streets of Salford.
OL,10,FThe Nissan Qashqai reached speeds of
OL,11,Fup to 100mph on 30mph roads.
OL,13,FThe pursuit lasted 45 minutes.
OL,15,FThe driver travelled against the flow
OL,16,Fof traffic at several roundabouts and
OL,17,Fwas eventually stopped after officers
OL,18,Fdeployed a stinger.
OL,20,FOne woman sustained minor injuries
OL,21,Ffollowing a collision.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
