PN,36602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785341919
OL,3,CTwo injured as man leads police on 45-
OL,4,Cminute car chase
OL,6,FAn officer required hospital treatment
OL,7,Ffor a hand injury.
OL,9,FEventually the car was stopped by the
OL,10,Fuse of a stinger.
OL,12,FA man, aged 36, was arrested on
OL,13,Fsuspicion of dangerous driving,
OL,14,Fdriving whilst disqualified and
OL,15,Ffailing to stop.
OL,17,FHe remains in police custody for
OL,18,Fquestioning.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785341919
OL,3,CTwo injured as man leads police on 45-
OL,4,Cminute car chase
OL,6,FPolice Sergeant Neil Molloy, of the
OL,7,FSpecialist Operations Team's Tactical
OL,8,FVehicle Intercept Unit, said: "This
OL,9,Flevel of driving is obviously
OL,10,Fextremely dangerous, and I'm thankful
OL,11,Fto report that no one was seriously
OL,12,Fhurt during this pursuit.
OL,14,F"The reckless actions of this man put
OL,15,Fmembers of the public at risk, and
OL,16,Fwe're incredibly lucky that no one
OL,17,Fsuffered serious injuries as a result
OL,18,Fof his actions.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/4
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
