OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785341919
OL,3,CTwo injured as man leads police on 45-
OL,4,Cminute car chase
OL,6,F"Driving in this manner through built-
OL,7,Fup residential areas is completely
OL,8,Funacceptable, and I am pleased that
OL,9,Four officers acted swiftly and
OL,10,Fprofessionally to bring the incident
OL,11,Fto a safe conclusion, secure an arrest
OL,12,Fand seize the vehicle."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/4
